From 77a934264496eee41e0ddb228f466119822f429f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hejiean <hejiean@eswincomputing.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Mar 2025 18:55:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 447/652] feat(kernel): Add CacheFlushAll API for lib_memory

Changelogs:
1. add type EIC770X_LOGICAL_MEM_NODE_E to encode numa node id, contains
	EIC770X_LOGICAL_FLAT_MEM_NODE_0,
	EIC770X_LOGICAL_FLAT_MEM_NODE_1,
	EIC770X_LOGICAL_SPRAM_NODE_0,
	EIC770X_LOGICAL_SPRAM_NODE_1,
	EIC770X_LOGICAL_INTERLEAVE_MEM_NODE.
2. cache_flush_all relate funtion flush caches use nid only.
3. uapi/linux/es_vb_user.h add defination of ES_U64,US_U32,ES_CHAR
4. fix compile error when CONFIG_ARCH_ESWIN_EIC770X_SOC_FAMILY not set

Signed-off-by: hejiean <hejiean@eswincomputing.com>
